  <item>
    <title>做播客一周年居然拥有90+订阅，我们究竟做对了什么！！！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/683aff5b31215eb506af89a9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">683aff5b31215eb506af89a9</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 02 Jun 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>标题恶搞一下，不是真的很骄傲订阅数，但是我们真的很骄傲坚持做了一年。一年了，值得一期节目来记录。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="11">00:11</a> </span><strong><span>正片开始</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="68">01:08</a> </span><strong><span>数据分析：高不成，低不就，我们就要胡乱分析</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;订阅数：感谢坚持听下去的每一个人</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;数据最好两期：果然还是得蹭热度啊 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66fe903c6c7f817786a748cb" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66fe903c6c7f817786a748cb"><span>雪迷宫</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67e0dae6dd11f9c8c1ae19fd" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67e0dae6dd11f9c8c1ae19fd"><span>雁回时</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;更新频率：也算是做到了双周更</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="459">07:39</a> </span><strong><span>做节目的初心：对不起，我们忘本了！！！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a> </span><strong><span>未来想进行的一些尝试</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;我们那无处安放的分享欲啊！还想各自单独再做一个节目</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;未来期待更多的串台机会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1370">22:50</a> </span><strong><span>节目的幕后故事：麦子老师的剪辑心得以及吗喽的论文式大纲</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;正式宣布，今后我们将用like，和you know来代替我们的口癖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2333">38:53</a> </span><strong><span>致谢环节：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;感谢听到这里的所有人</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;感谢可爱有趣的猪罐头老师，</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67a97962d74435e4a32e09dc" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67a97962d74435e4a32e09dc"><span>东北旅行</span></a><span> 这一期请务必听一下，真的很有趣</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;感谢 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/644def38396b751cc44be12f" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/644def38396b751cc44be12f"><span>主流之外</span></a><span> 和我们一起串台，给我们带来了知识量如此丰富的一期节目</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;感谢 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6432a9679361a4e7c3106174" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6432a9679361a4e7c3106174"><span>地摊Radio</span></a><span> 的马老司，和我们分享了很多做节目的经验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="259">04:19</a> </span><strong><span>关于未来我们也有些许焦虑：害怕被过度解读，也有数据焦虑</span></strong></p>]]></description>
